            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time this unit or the replacement of this unit is destroyed, set up a replacement unit in reserve **masked by illusion**. Each friendly **Chaos Spawn of Tzeentch** unit can be replaced any number of times.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
