• Each time you make a successful ward roll for this unit, allocate 1 damage point to a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** **^^Arcanite^^** unit within this unit&apos;s combat range after the damage sequence for this unit has been resolved (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).</characteristic>
