          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit&apos;s **Brimstone Horror** is a token. When this unit&apos;s **Blue Horror** is slain, place this unit&apos;s **Brimstone Horror** on the battlefield. Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit&apos;s **Mighty Sorcerous Bolt** while its **Brimstone Horror** is on the battlefield. If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for this unit, remove this unit&apos;s **Brimstone Horror** from the battlefield.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
