                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the target is destroyed this turn, before removing it from play, gain 1 **fate point**.</characteristic>
