                        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">This unit can only use this ability if it is **masked by illusion**. Pick a model in a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit can immediately use a **^^Spell^^** ability. When it does so, measure the range and visibility of that **^^Spell^^** ability from the target.</characteristic>
